<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $55 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $55 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Wednesday it placed $55 million in overnight repurchase agreements at 9.0 percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, call money was flat at 6.13 percent.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar rose to 0.99983 pesos from 0.99982 pesos.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0668))</p>
</text>
